From 2032587689f14ddc2ac2df1e8107956ac83a6788 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:28:53 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] fix(language): natural sentence timing, length-budgeted
 translation, refit of long speech, exchange rate

- ASR: Whisper word timestamps regrouped into sentences at pauses (max ~9 s); segment
  timestamps had collapsed into one 46 s block plus fixed 2 s windows on live-stream audio.
- Translation: each sentence carries its seconds and a max character budget; optional
  exchange_rate converts RMB prices (e.g. 1:5.08) instead of the fixed 'never convert' rule.
- Speech that still overruns its slot is re-worded shorter and spoken again (2 rounds)
  instead of failing alignment; alignment may use the silence before the next sentence.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
